      "instance_name": "celebratory_pregnancy_announcement",
      "label": "Celebratory pregnancy announcement scene",
      "description": "A joyful scene where two women, both wearing hijabs, are sharing a moment of happiness as one gently touches the pregnant belly of the other. The text overlay 'it's a boy' confirms the announcement of a male child. The scene is warm, centered on maternal joy and female camaraderie, with the pregnant woman smiling broadly and the other woman looking down at her belly with affection. The spatial arrangement places the pregnant woman slightly to the left and the other woman to her right, with their hands overlapping on the belly, creating a sense of shared intimacy and celebration.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_388d7091"
